WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.001 --> 00:00:08.009
Skyler: I want my parrot back!

2
00:00:08.010 --> 00:00:12.781
Riley: Don't worry. We'll find a way to get Chatter back.

3
00:00:12.782 --> 00:00:14.542
Ben: There's the zookeeper.

4
00:00:14.543 --> 00:00:18.210
Maybe he can help us.

5
00:00:18.211 --> 00:00:21.543
Skyler: Sir, please help us!

6
00:00:21.544 --> 00:00:25.075
My parrot flew into the cage!

7
00:00:25.076 --> 00:00:28.732
Theo: And now we can't tell which one is hers.

8
00:00:28.733 --> 00:00:31.992
Ben: And which one is the zoo's!

9
00:00:31.993 --> 00:00:40.451
Zookeeper: Wait. You mean one of those parrots is yours?

10
00:00:40.452 --> 00:00:44.008
Skyler: Yes, and I want my parrot right now!

11
00:00:44.009 --> 00:00:45.950
Zookeeper: Try calling him.

12
00:00:45.951 --> 00:00:49.438
Maybe he'll fly over to you.

13
00:00:49.439 --> 00:00:52.388
Skyler: Here, Chatter!

14
00:00:52.389 --> 00:00:56.688
Chatter: Here, Chatter. Ha-ha. Ha-ha.

15
00:00:56.689 --> 00:00:59.821
Skyler: See, that's Chatter!

16
00:00:59.822 --> 00:01:06.495
Zoo parrot: Here, Chatter. Ha-ha. Ha-ha.

17
00:01:06.496 --> 00:01:09.042
Skyler: Maybe it's not Chatter!

18
00:01:09.043 --> 00:01:13.001
I'm so confused!

19
00:01:13.002 --> 00:01:14.855
What am I going to do? I can't

20
00:01:14.856 --> 00:01:17.877
go home without Chatter. Chatter: Go

21
00:01:17.878 --> 00:01:20.753
home! Do your homework! Skyler: Chatter!

22
00:01:20.754 --> 00:01:25.885
It is you! Zookeeper: Are

23
00:01:25.886 --> 00:01:29.062
you sure that's your bird? Skyler: Yes.

24
00:01:29.063 --> 00:01:33.720
Only Chatter would tell me to do my homework! Zookeeper: Okay.

25
00:01:33.721 --> 00:01:44.682
I'll unlock the cage and get your bird. Skyler: Oh,

26
00:01:44.683 --> 00:01:48.379
Chatter, I'm so glad to have you back! Chatter: Wipe

27
00:01:48.380 --> 00:01:50.008
your feet! Time to

28
00:01:50.009 --> 00:01:51.949
eat! Mrs. Summers:

29
00:01:51.950 --> 00:01:53.994
It is time to eat. Riley:

30
00:01:53.995 --> 00:01:56.634
I'm really hungry! Sarah:

31
00:01:56.635 --> 00:01:58.723
I am too. Mrs.

32
00:01:58.724 --> 00:02:11.549
Summers: Let's go have lunch!

33
00:02:11.550 --> 00:02:13.272
Ben: That was fun.

34
00:02:13.273 --> 00:02:16.517
I'm glad the Pet Lovers Club went to the zoo.

35
00:02:16.518 --> 00:02:20.879
Chatter: Squawk. Me too!

36
00:02:20.880 --> 00:02:22.997
Riley: That was very fun.

37
00:02:22.998 --> 00:02:31.099
But I can't wait to see Snooks!

